Subject: [PATCH 1061/1062] SableOS: pure FM bridge protocol for Sable Media

The message numbers, state keys, band limits and caller policy of the
Sable FM bridge, in plain Java so they are tested on the host.
---
 .../fmradio/sable/SableFmProtocol.java        | 114 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 114 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/fmradio/sable/SableFmProtocol.java

diff --git a/src/com/android/fmradio/sable/SableFmProtocol.java b/src/com/android/fmradio/sable/SableFmProtocol.java
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e59f155
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/com/android/fmradio/sable/SableFmProtocol.java
@@ -0,0 +1,114 @@
